  "details": "Most of the time when sitting next to someone I set my personal mirror to show players, this ends up mirroring everyone behind me, even if they're across the map.\n\nNot only is this distracting, it's also wasteful for performance as those players are now being rendered. \n\nHaving an option to adjust the distance of the mirror camera's far clip plane would be very useful in these situations, both for comfort and performance.",
